# the note's own probes, re-run at 6fe5170cd (design seat's round-4 probes)
## probe_feed.py
## A1: one probe run, the live pairing (the defect at main)
  2.0 h step (4 cycles): folded=5 stored=4 values=[1.5, 3.0, 3.0, 3.0]
  1.0 h step (2 cycles): folded=3 stored=2 values=[1.5, 3.0]
  control: gate-held pre-step draw is idle (0.0 kW)
  2.0 h: folded=5 stored=3 values=[3.0, 3.0, 3.0]
  1.0 h: folded=3 stored=1 values=[3.0]

## A2: one probe run, the interval-owned pairing (the re-cut)
  2.0 h step (4 cycles): folded=5 stored=4 values=[3.0, 3.0, 3.0, 3.0]
  1.0 h step (2 cycles): folded=3 stored=2 values=[3.0, 3.0]
  control: a gate-held pre-step draw above idle (1.4 kW, command at the gate)
  2.0 h: folded=5 stored=4 values=[3.0, 3.0, 3.0, 3.0]
  1.0 h: folded=3 stored=2 values=[3.0, 3.0]
  control: outside the probe the plan runs (1.5 kW, plan command)
  plan-only intervals: folded=12 stored=0 values=[]

## A3: twelve store samples
  live 2.0 h: 12 samples from 3 runs -> median 3.0 adopted=True (bar 4.25)
  live 1.0 h: 12 samples from 6 runs -> median 2.25 adopted=True (bar 4.25)
  own 2.0 h: 12 samples from 3 runs -> median 3.0 adopted=True (bar 4.25)
  own 1.0 h: 12 samples from 6 runs -> median 3.0 adopted=True (bar 4.25)
  control: twelve true ceiling draws -> (3.0, 12, True)
  control: twelve draws at 90% of configured -> (4.5, 12, False)

## A4: idle discrimination the store inherits
  no idle learned: idle_kw=None floor=RUNNING_FLOOR_KW only
  after 12 idle readings at 1.1 kW: idle_kw=1.100 margin=1.375
  a 1.4 kW gate-held draw above the idle is a running sample by is_running_space: True | admitted by the store: False
  control: the same draw with the ceiling written is admitted: True

## probe_reader.py
## B1: the reader chain at main
  the note's F6 case: 48 ceiling in a full 336 window: observed=(1.5, 3.0) engaged=False planned=None high=3.0 effective_max_kw=None
  F6 control: 47 ceiling in a full 336 window: observed=(1.5, None) engaged=False planned=None high=None effective_max_kw=None
  twelve ceiling samples in the window: observed=(1.5, None) engaged=False planned=None high=None effective_max_kw=None
